※ pl4g-test: expect-diag 4203 LANG_TYPE_INITIALIZER_MISMATCH

※ What an iterator's type says it gives is what it gives: a pick out of bytes
※ is no walk of `u16`.

@[startup]
fn main() → u6:
    let arr: u8⟦4⟧ = ⟦0u8, 1u8, 2u8, 3u8⟧ in ⎕static
    let q: ⇉u16 = arr⟦arr > 1⟧
    0u6
